Package: spectralDEMATEL
Title: Spectral Diagnostics for DEMATEL Influence Matrices
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R:
    person("Pavlos", "Delias", email = "pavlos.delias@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3722-2307"))
Description: Computes the spectral diagnostics of a DEMATEL influence
    matrix: coupling and the total-effect multiplier, indirect and mode
    dominance, three readings of hierarchy, the entry and accumulation
    profiles, the eigenvalue condition number, a permutation surrogate
    baseline, and the closed-form derivative of the dominant eigenvalue in
    every off-diagonal entry. The package computes and returns data. It does
    not draw, read files, or print, so it can be driven equally from a script,
    a batch job, or a browser-side application compiled to WebAssembly.
